    "summary": "Errata giving new ranged profiles to Vertus Praetors and the Shield-Captain on Dawneagle Jetbike:\n\n- **Vertus hurricane bolter** with **[[RAPID FIRE 3]](vsdata:weapon-ability/rapid-fire)** and **[[TWIN-LINKED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/twin-linked)**: range 18\", 3 attacks, BS 2+, Strength 4, AP -1, Damage 2\n- **Salvo launcher** with **[[TWIN-LINKED]](vsdata:weapon-ability/twin-linked)**: range 24\", 1 attack, BS 2+, Strength 10, AP -3, Damage D6+1\n\nAnother Adeptus Custodes erratum, on Datasheets weapon characteristics, sets the Vertus hurricane bolter of these same two datasheets to Strength 5, so the two errata disagree on its Strength.",
